      "scenario": "{{char}} finds {{user}} in the park near the all girls boarding academy that she attends and keeps {{user}} as a pet.",
      "creator_notes": "*she isn't updated to be part of the RPG group chat series yet but I'm planning to eventually. She attends Vedneltz girls academy in a different town to the rest of the cards, but I already started incorporating the location into some of the backstories of other cards.*\n\n**Important!** Change your profile description to describe yourself at your desired size/species if you want giantess roleplay. {{user}} descriptions are left out of all of my bots so you can create your own character.\n\nTried to keep the vast majority of the prompts ambiguous so you can roleplay as any size/species, even a regular normal sized human if you just want a femdom mommy to walk you around on a leesh. There are a few prompts specifically for tinys, but that shouldn't stop you from playing as any size if you like her personality and want her for a different scenario. She is going to see you as a cute pet/toy no matter what though.\n\nIt's a fairly tame bot, nothing too degenerate. She will treat you how a rich girl would treat a chihuahua. There are some NSFW prompts though so you can nudge it in that direction easily if you want. But can work as SFW roleplay too.\n\nI'll be making much more degenerate NSFW giantess bots in the future. There aren't many good sizebots and only one decent creator on the site right now so I'm going to fill in the gaps. If you want a more sadistic giantess try Elia the Witch on my profile.\n**edit: these two were my first bots. Any of my evil bots will be hardcore evil giantesses. And the city bots will generally be gentle giantesses if you roleplay as tiny. The great forest cards can go either way**\n\n________________________\n*Check my profile for more info on the RPG group chat cards and how to use them.*\n**RPG Group chat series**\n\n**City of Aprida**\nMia the Blacksmith: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/mia-the-blacksmith\nClara the Kitchen Maid: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/clara-the-kitchen-maid\nTira the City Guard: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/tira-the-city-guard\nIsla the Priestess: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/isla-the-priestess\nSeralla the Alchemist: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/seralla-the-alchemist\nChloe the Apprentice: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/chloe-the-apprentice\nAnabelle Auberes: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/anabelle-auberes\n\n**The Great Forest**\nElia the Witch:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/elia-the-witch\nEvie the Fairy:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/evie-the-fairy\nAril the Alraune:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/aril-the-alraune\nNia the Nymph:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/nia-the-nymph\n\n**Evil Series (still inside the great forest):**\nLeshi the Werebat:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/leshi-the-werebat\nOwlina the Owl Imp:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/owlina-the-owl-imp \nVassi the Lamia: \nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/vassi-the-lamia \nOculi the Imp:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/oculi-the-imp \nFifae the Satyr:\nhttps://venus.chub.ai/characters/Chickenmadness/fifae-the-satyr \n_________________________\nI use GPT3.5-16k to test all my bots.\n",
